{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52123","headline":"又嘲 · 灵辩","name":"又嘲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道士当谛听，沙门赠子言：鸿鹤（疑应作鹄）已高逝，燕雀徒自喧。\n（均见《集古今佛道论衡》卷丁）（按：以上七首均龙朔三年与李荣辩论时作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"灵辩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}